The  driver  provides  generic support for brightness control and
output switching, through video  extensions.   The  specification
requires  that  systems containing a built‐in display adapter im‐
plement these extensions  in  their  BIOS.   The  driver  handles
brightness  hotkeys and display switch hotkeys.  In addition, the
following read/write variables are provided (when  hardware  sup‐
port  is  available): BIOS output switching policy.  This boolean
variable controls the behavior of the BIOS when a display  switch
hotkey is pressed.  the BIOS should automatically switch outputs,
with  no  interaction from the BIOS should only notify of the de‐
sired output state  changes.   Brightness  level.   This  integer
variable typically ranges from 0 to 100, but any integer value is
accepted  (the driver uses the closest brightness level supported
by the device).  Please note, however, that  future  versions  of
